{
  "info": {
    "name": "AI Writer API",
    "description": "Koleksi API backend AI Article Generator. Urutan folder = urutan jalan di Collection Runner.\n\n**Persiapan**\n1. Jalankan server dengan `COOKIE_SECURE=false` (cookie Secure tidak dikirim lewat http://localhost).\n2. Buat admin: `go run ./cmd/seed -email ... -name ...`.\n3. Isi variabel koleksi `adminEmail` dan `adminPassword` (tab Variables).\n\n**Aturan umum**\n- Request selain GET wajib header `X-Requested-With: fetch`.\n- Sesi disimpan di cookie `session`; Postman mengirimnya otomatis setelah Login.\n- Error sebelum streaming berbentuk `{error, code, fields?}`.",
