            "description": "Input tidak valid ditolak 400 sebelum memanggil Gemini (tidak memakai kuota).\n\nAturan: `type` berita/artikel (wajib); `topic` 5–500 karakter (wajib); `keywords` ≤ 200; `tone` formal/santai/persuasif/edukatif (default formal); `length` pendek/sedang/panjang (default sedang); `language` id/en (default id); `facts` ≤ 4.000 karakter.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"opini\",\n  \"topic\": \"abc\",\n  \"language\": \"jv\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test(\"code = invalid_input\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"invalid_input\"));",
                  "const f = pm.response.json().fields;",
                  "pm.test(\"detail per field\", () => pm.expect(f).to.include.keys(\"type\", \"topic\", \"language\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Generate — berita",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Requested-With",
                "value": "fetch"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Generate draf dengan streaming SSE. Akses: user & admin (perlu Login). Rate limit `RATE_LIMIT_PER_MIN` per user.\n\n**Urutan event sukses**\n```\nevent: meta\ndata: {\"model\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\"}\n\ndata: {\"text\":\"# Judul ...\"}\n\nevent: done\ndata: {\"stop_reason\":\"stop\",\"input_tokens\":381,\"output_tokens\":526}\n```\n`stop_reason` = `max_tokens` berarti draf terpotong batas panjang.\n\n**Error sebelum teks pertama** (JSON biasa): 400 `invalid_input`, 401, 413, 429 `rate_limited`, 422 `content_blocked`, 502 `upstream_error`, 503 `upstream_overloaded`, 504 `timeout`.\n\n**Error di tengah stream**: `event: error` dengan `{error, code}` (`upstream_overloaded`, `timeout`, `content_blocked`, `upstream_error`).\n\nDraf utuh disimpan ke variabel `lastDraft` dan dicetak di Console. Setiap request memanggil Gemini (memakai kuota).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"berita\",\n  \"topic\": \"Pembukaan jalur bus listrik baru di Makassar\",\n  \"keywords\": \"bus listrik, transportasi publik, Makassar\",\n  \"tone\": \"formal\",\n  \"length\": \"pendek\",\n  \"language\": \"id\",\n  \"facts\": \"- Diresmikan Senin, 5 Okt 2026\\n- Rute: Pantai Losari – Bandara\\n- Sumber: rilis Dishub Kota Makassar\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"content-type SSE\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(\"text/event-stream\"));",
                  "const body = pm.response.text();",
                  "pm.test(\"diawali event meta\", () => pm.expect(body.trimStart()).to.match(/^event: meta\\n/));",
                  "const done = body.match(/event: done\\ndata: (.+)/);",
                  "pm.test(\"diakhiri event done\", () => pm.expect(done, \"tidak ada event done (cek event: error)\").to.not.be.null);",
                  "if (done) {",
                  "  const d = JSON.parse(done[1]);",
                  "  pm.test(\"token tercatat\", () => pm.expect(d.output_tokens).to.be.above(0));",
                  "}",
                  "// Gabungkan semua potongan teks menjadi draf utuh (lihat tab Console).",
                  "const draft = body.split(\"\\n\").filter(l => l.startsWith('data: {\"text\"')).map(l => JSON.parse(l.slice(6)).text).join(\"\");",
                  "pm.test(\"draf tidak kosong\", () => pm.expect(draft.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"lastDraft\", draft);",
                  "console.log(draft);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
